Bedrud configuration examples
=============================

These files are reference templates only. They are not used at runtime.

Installed live config (written by `sudo bedrud install`):
  /etc/bedrud/config.yaml
  /etc/bedrud/livekit.yaml

Quick start
-----------
1. Prefer generating a full install (secrets, services, TLS):

     sudo bedrud install

2. Or copy an example and edit placeholders (CHANGE_ME_*):

     sudo cp /usr/share/doc/bedrud/examples/config.yaml.example /etc/bedrud/config.yaml
     sudo cp /usr/share/doc/bedrud/examples/livekit.yaml.example /etc/bedrud/livekit.yaml
     sudo chmod 600 /etc/bedrud/config.yaml /etc/bedrud/livekit.yaml
     # edit secrets, domain, ports
     sudo systemctl enable --now livekit bedrud

Docs: https://bedrud.org/  and  https://themadorg.github.io/bedrud/

Update the server binary:
  sudo bedrud update --self              # use this running binary
  sudo bedrud update /path/to/bedrud     # bare binary
  sudo bedrud update latest              # GitHub latest (checksum verified)
